    "type_of_notice_description": "Notice",
    "short_title": "New York City Workforce Development Board Local Plan Public Comment Period\u00a0\u00a0",
    "section_name": "Agency Rules",
    "event_date": null,
    "additional_description_1": "<p style='text-align:center'><strong>New York City Local Plan Public Comment Period\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p style='text-align:center'><strong>8/18/2025 - 9/5/2025\u00a0</strong></p><p style='text-align:center'><strong>NEW YORK CITY WORKFORCE DEVELOPMENT BOARD WORKFORCE INNOVATION AND OPPORTUNITY ACT (WIOA) LOCAL PLAN\u00a0</strong></p><p>In accordance with the requirements of the Workforce Innovation and Opportunity Act (WIOA), the New York City Workforce Development Board must, in partnership with the Mayor, prepare a four-year Local Plan to identify and describe the policies, procedures, and local activities that are carried out in the local area, consistent with the?<a href='https://www.law.cornell.edu/definitions/index.php?width=840&height=800&iframe=true&def_id=2ee9ad170e8df411dff83f3459e9dbcc&term_occur=999&term_src=Title:20:Chapter:V:Part:679:Subpart:D:679.550' target='_blank'>State</a>?Plan. This Plan spans Program Years 2025\u001a2028, covering the period of July 1, 2025, to June 30, 2029. \u00a0</p><p>After soliciting extensive stakeholder input from members and key stakeholders, the Board is pleased to make the WIOA Local Plan available for public review until September 5, 2025. Members of the public can view the Local Plan at https://www.nyc.gov/site/wkdev/workforce-board/governance.page and email any comments about the Plan to redacted@example.com.\u00a0</p>"
